"""
Seed the Arabian Gulf EEZ delimitation lines into map_asset.
Self-contained: 23 offshore boundary lines from the Marine Regions (VLIZ)
`eez_boundaries` dataset, Gulf bbox, filtered to real delimitation types
(Treaty, Median line, Court ruling, Unsettled variants). Coastal
"Straight baseline" and administrative "Connection line" stubs are
excluded on purpose, as is a stray Hawaii 200 NM bbox artefact.

Geometry was simplified offline (Douglas-Peucker, ~1 km tolerance):
12,797 -> 199 points. Chart-level only; never a navigational reference.

Re-running REPLACES the 'eez_boundaries' source rows only - manual assets
and other sources are never touched. The EEZ overlay chip stays default
OFF (opt-in) on the tracker maps.

Run in the PORTAL container:
    cd /code && python -m app.tools.seed_eez_gulf

Source: Flanders Marine Institute (VLIZ), Maritime Boundaries Geodatabase,
marineregions.org.
"""
import os
